This project runs the Depth Anything V2 Small model through Hugging Face
Transformers. Model weights are not included in this source tree. Obtain and
redistribute model files only under their own license and terms:
https://huggingface.co/depth-anything/Depth-Anything-V2-Small-hf

Runtime dependencies retain their respective licenses (PyTorch, Transformers,
OpenCV, NumPy and Pillow). This repository contains no model weights and makes
no network calls during inference.
